*.bin

# Allowed: the generated, CC0-licensed samples, the app's own assets and the README's screenshots.
!samples/**
!public/**
!src/**
!docs/**

# Never committed: real files for local testing.
samples/private/*
!samples/private/README.md

# Office lock and temp files (they contain the user name), also inside the allowed folders above.
**/~$*
**/~*.tmp
**/.~lock.*#

